The owned-unit deletion bound builds on the exact 8-term decoder normal form
and the max(72 - p, 56) bound of research/complex-frame-pair-decoders (PR968)
and its authors. The chart family and Fourier-rank formula are quoted from
notes/general-clifford-frames.tex (icekylinx, with the attribution stated in
that file); the dot-product label space and terminal labels are quoted from
the specification upstream/build/sections/03-motifs.tex.

All checkers in this package are our own code; no code is imported from the
repository or any other package. data/lp-dual-c2.json holds dual multipliers
of a linear program; the bound is recomputed from them by weak duality, so its
validity does not depend on the solver that produced them.
